    <p class="tag">Fluid is a free, open-source (MIT), non-custodial wallet for every blockchain. One seed phrase derives your accounts on EVM chains and L2s (15 built in, more auto-discovered), Bitcoin and Lightning, Stacks (the Bitcoin L2), Litecoin, Dogecoin, Bitcoin Cash, Tron, Solana, Sui, seven Cosmos chains, Stellar, TON, NEAR, Algorand, the XRP Ledger, Polkadot Asset Hub and Aptos \u2014 and every chain both sends and receives.</p>
